BT /F1 9 Tf 40 228 Td (- Do not hardcode location radius in the app. Use the radius returned by mapped locations API.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 40 216 Td (- For image APIs, prefer multipart upload when possible. Use JSON Base64 only when multipart is) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 40 204 Td (not suitable.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 40 192 Td (- Do not store passwords in the app.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 40 180 Td (- For forgot password without login, use a separate OTP/token API. Do not use the authenticated) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 40 168 Td (reset endpoint.) Tj ET
